## Compatibility change

- Added 108 invoked Java heartbeat DTO cases covering each of 54 C0/Unicode
  separator values after U+001A and between repeated U+001A markers. Added two
  more cases for trailing text and a second JSON object after the marker. Java
  accepts all 110; the earlier native differential failed on the 108 separator
  cases.
- The heartbeat DTO corpus now contains 1,221 cases. Rust truncates at the
  first raw U+001A after syntax and string normalization. Raw U+001A within a
  quoted string remains part of the decoded value.
- This closes the tested Fastjson end-of-input boundary only. Broad P18-V01
  source/API/settings/input/error/control-flow and reverse-export
  reconciliation remains PARTIAL.

